<mxCell id="c25" value="Cloud DNS sends forwarded&lt;br&gt;queries from this range.&lt;br&gt;Advertise it from&lt;br&gt;Cloud Router to AWS, route it&lt;br&gt;back over the interconnect, and&lt;br&gt;allow it in the inbound&lt;br&gt;endpoint's security group.&lt;br&gt;Otherwise answers never&lt;br&gt;come back." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3C4043;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="652" y="372" width="200" height="137" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
