<mxCell id="c35" value="1  EKS asks VPC resolver, rule sends gcp.corp.example out&lt;br&gt;2  Outbound endpoint queries Cloud DNS inbound policy IPs&lt;br&gt;3  GKE query follows the peering zone to the DNS hub&lt;br&gt;4  Forwarding zone queries the Route 53 inbound endpoint" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="600" width="560" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
